size of the full\nprompt, your static block isn't byte-stable — hunt the interpolated value.\n{\n \"42\": {\"user_id\": \"42\", \"name\": \"Marta\", \"lang\": \"en\", \"sport\": \"running\", \"goal\": \"sub-1:55 half marathon in June\",\n        \"zones\": {\"Z1\": \"<138\", \"Z2\": \"138-152\", \"Z3\": \"152-164\", \"Z4\": \"164-174\", \"Z5\": \">174\"},\n        \"facts\": [\"Runs before work, 06:30, Mon/Wed/Fri\", \"Left achilles tendinopathy in 2024, fully recovered\", \"Owns a Garmin 255\"]},\n \"77\": {\"user_id\": \"77\", \"name\": \"Jonas\", \"lang\": \"de\", \"sport\": \"cycling\", \"goal\": \"finish a 160 km gran fondo in September\",\n        \"zones\": {\"Z1\": \"<130\", \"Z2\": \"130-146\", \"Z3\": \"146-158\", \"Z4\": \"158-168\", \"Z5\": \">168\"},\n        \"facts\": [\"Commutes by bike 2x15 km daily\", \"Has a smart trainer at home\"]}\n}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01YHXPV2QrMCXedjW4BB2Rgi","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
