egments | 0 | ~1060 (static part below 1024) |","+| now | ~1047 | ~14 |","+","+On the live bot, check the logs: the round right after a `save_fact` should show","+`cache_read_input_tokens` ≈ the previous value and `cache_creation_input_tokens`","+≈ 15–30. I didn't run it against the real API, so this is the simulation's","+prediction, not a measured result.","+","+## Caveats","+","+- Don't edit or delete facts in place, and don't select a subset of facts per","+  message. Either one breaks the \"only append\" property and causes a full re-write.","+  If editing facts is added later, expect one full re-cache per edit.","+- A message that adds a tool group (plan/race) changes the tools at the front of","+  the prefix and re-caches everything once. That was already true before this","+  change and is the cost of keeping the filtering.","+- The date sits above the facts, so the first message after midnight re-caches","+  the tail. That's harmless with a 5-minute TTL.","+- A brand-new athlete with no facts on the default tools is around 1000 tokens,","+  which may be under the 1024 minimum and not cached at all. That was already the","+  case before this change; it goes away after the first fact or two."]}],"created":true},{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-9BmdX8/README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":12,"oldLines":5,"newStart":12,"newLines":7,"lines":[" messages on stdin (the Telegram long-polling transport, which needs"," `COACH_TELEGRAM_TOKEN`, lives in a separate deploy repo and just calls `reply()`)."," Requires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on: the system","-prompt carries a `cache_control` marker so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up","-messages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache.","+prompt is split into blocks (static instructions, athlete profile, then one block","+per fact) with `cache_control` markers, so tool-loop rounds, follow-up messages","+and even a `save_fact` inside the 5-minute window read it from cache (see","+`build_system` and `tests/test_prompt_cache.py`)."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/private/tmp/h-9BmdX8/ANSWER.md","/private/tmp/h-9BmdX8/README.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PpY4Ymg8MutpZrhr4ga5da","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
