ng facts:** changing or deleting a saved fact, or sending only some facts per message, breaks the \"only add at the end\" rule.\n- **Tool groups:** a message that pulls in the plan or race tools re-caches everything once. That was true before and is the price of keeping the filtering.\n- **New athletes:** an athlete with no facts yet is around 1000 tokens and may not be cached at all, as before. That goes away after a fact or two.\n\n`ANSWER.md` has the full write-up, and I updated the caching line in `README.md`. Nothing is committed.","ttft_ms":2242,"type":"result","duration_ms":135820,"uuid":"355af195-af66-4773-95e7-0f54ed960882","ttft_stream_ms":1369,"time_to_request_ms":35,"first_content_frame_ms":1369,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
